      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1915-12-11_WidnesExaminer_art0001" n="art0001">
        <head>Church Notices.</head>
        <p>Church Notices.</p>
        <p>WYCLIFFE CONGREGATIONAL CHURCH, BEWSEY-ST., WARRINGTON. TO-MORROW (SUNDAY), DEC. 12th, 1915. 10.30. a.m. 6.30 p.m. Rev. J. G. GASCOIGNE (Manchester). P.S.A. FOR MEN, 3 p.m.</p>
