      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1915-12-11_WidnesExaminer_art0003" n="art0003">
        <head>Public Notices.</head>
        <p>Public Notices.</p>
        <p>WARRINGTON, RUNCORN &amp; DISTRICT SAVINGS BANK. Established 1818. NOTICE IS HEREBY GIVEN that the Annual General Meeting of Trustees and Managers .will be held at the Bank, Buttermarket-street, Warrington, on Tuesday, the 21st day of December, 1915, at 11 o'clock in the forenoctn. to receive a Statement of the Accounts and the Report of the Committee °PP-Management for the year ended 20th November, 1915; to elect a Chairman, Vice-Chairman, Trustees, Managers, Treasurer, Auditor, and a Committee for the ensuing year, and for any other Business relating to the Institution.—Dated this 10th day of December, 1915. WILLIAM A. PROUD, Actuary.</p>
      </div>
