      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1915-12-11_WidnesExaminer_art0063" n="art0063">
        <head>In Memoriam.</head>
        <p>In Memoriam.</p>
        <p>MATHER.—In loving memory of our dear mother, Martha Mather, who died December 6th, 1912, aged 82 years. Willow Tree Farm, Burtonwood.</p>
