        <head>TO-DAY'S MATCHES.</head>
        <p>TO-DAY'S MATCHES.</p>
        <p>At Wilderspool. Ifeathside v. Sacred Heart. Referee, Mr. J. Beardsall. Kick-off 2.15. Beamont v. St. James'. Flynn. Kick-off 3.15.</p>
