        <p>TOWN COUNCIL. Members' Tributes to Alderman Burton. RECRUITING AT THE BATHS. The monthly meeting of the Warrington Town Council was held on Tuesday evening, the Mayor (Alderman Peter Peacock) presiding. The 31 mit. said that he had received a letter from Mr. E. Osborne thanking the members of the Council for the vote of thanks passed to him at the last meeting for his services to the Corporation. ALDERMAN BURTON'S SERVICES. Dr. JOSEPH (the deputy-chairman of the Health Committee) referred to a resolution of the Health Committee which expressed their hearty appreciation of .the services of Alder- man Burton, the late deputy-chairman, and the ,hope that he would soon be able to resume his duties on the committee. Dr. Joseph said that there was no member of the Council more</p>
