        <p>WOUNDED. PRIVATE. W. IL LEXIIIER. • Sankey Bridges Threshing Machine Attendant. Private William Henry Leather, whose wife and eight children reside at 29. Rodney-street, has .been wounded,in the 'Dardanelles whilst serving in the..EnUineers, and is now in hos- pital at Malta.-, Private Leather is 35 years nf age. When the war began he was a driver of a threshing machine in .the employ. of Mr. Walter 'Fitter, Mod-lane, Sankey Bridges.</p>
