        <p>The Cornis,;-, Riviera FOR HEALTH AND SUNSHINE. THE CORNISH RIVIERA is the ideal Autumn and Winter resort of the British Isles, where the climatic and scenic advantages, usually associated with foreign resorts, may be enjoyed to the full. It has a climate that is wonderfully mild and equable, and well favoured with health-giving sunshine, and possesses a coast scenery and countryside of marvellous beauty. Facilities are afforded for all kinds of recreation. Full particulars of train services and fares can be obtained from Stations or Offices, or from the Superintendent of the Line, Paddington Station, 117. G , , , .W.R• FRANK POTTER, General Manager.</p>
